1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/computer-net/net-udp-tcp-kcp-quic","children":["从第一性原理掌握 UDP/TCP/KCP/QUIC"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"article-hero article-cover","children":["$","img",null,{"className":"u-photo","src":"https://hedon.top/hedonspace/banner/net-udp-tcp-kcp-quic.jpg","alt":"从第一性原理掌握 UDP/TCP/KCP/QUIC 的文章封面"}]}],["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"计算机基础"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"从第一性原理掌握 UDP/TCP/KCP/QUIC"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"本文将结合第一性原理，深入解析 UDP、TCP、KCP 和 QUIC 协议的设计动机、核心机制及其区别，助你真正理解它们为何而生、如何演化、彼此之间有何联系与差异。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2025-11-26T23:42:00.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2025/11/26"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","9,088"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","p","p-0",{"children":"相信不少读者跟笔者一样，对计算机网络中传输层的各种协议背了又忘，忘了又背，背了还完。所以本篇想尝试从第一性原理出发，看看能否从根上去掌握传输层中的 UDP、TCP、KCP 和 QUIC 协议（尽管 KCP 和 QUIC 是在应用层进行实现的，不过因为其实现的功能属于传输层的范畴，所以笔者在本篇将将这二者归为传输层）。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"特此声明，本篇是笔者与 Google Gemini 3Pro 共创所作，非常庆幸在当今 AI 时代下获取知识已是如此便利，且也为学习者从第一性原理理解所学知识大大降低了门槛。不过本篇的篇章安排和叙述逻辑，均由笔者把控和审阅，欢迎放心阅读。"}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"1-宏观理解","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#1-宏观理解","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#1-宏观理解"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"1. 宏观理解","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":4,"offset":285},"end":{"line":5,"column":11,"offset":292}}}]},"children":"1. 宏观理解"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":["之所以背了又忘，通常是因为我们把传输层看作是一堆枯燥的字段（Flags、Window size）和死记硬背的流程（三次握手、四次挥手），而忽略了它存在的",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"核心目的"}],"和",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"演化逻辑"}],"。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":["要从根本上理解传输层（Transport Layer），我们需要剥离掉具体的协议细节，回归到第一性原理：",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"传输层到底解决了什么网络层（IP）解决不了的问题？"}]]}],"\n",["$","h3","h3-0",{"id":"12-三个层级","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#12-三个层级","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#12-三个层级"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"1.2 三个层级","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":5,"offset":477},"end":{"line":11,"column":13,"offset":485}}}]},"children":"1.2 三个层级"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"children":["我们可以将其分解为三个层级来理解：",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"复用与分用"}],"、",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"不可靠基础上的可靠性"}],"、",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"传输效率的权衡"}],"。"]}],"\n",["$","h4","h4-0",{"id":"121-第一层级复用与复用","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#121-第一层级复用与复用","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#121-第一层级复用与复用"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"1.2.1 第一层级：复用与复用","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":6,"offset":548},"end":{"line":15,"column":22,"offset":564}}}]},"children":"1.2.1 第一层级：复用与复用"}]}],"\n",["$","blockquote","blockquote-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["$","span","span-0",{"className":"garden-callout-marker garden-callout-marker--warning","aria-hidden":"true"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"👉🏻 核心逻辑"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":["从",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"主机到主机"}],"进化为",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"进程到进程"}],"。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-5",{"children":"网络层（IP 层）的任务非常纯粹：通过 IP 地址，把数据包从地球的一端（主机 A）送到另一端（主机 B）。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-6",{"children":"但是，当数据包到达主机 B 时，IP 的任务就结束了。主机 B 此时正运行着微信、浏览器、Steam 和网易云音乐。这个数据包到底是给谁的？IP 协议不知道，也不管。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-7",{"children":["这就是传输层存在的",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"第一个根本原因"}],"："]}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"网络层"}],"只负责把快递送到",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"大楼传达室"}],"（主机 IP）。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"传输层"}],"负责把快递分发给大楼里的",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"具体某个人"}],"（进程 Port）。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n","$L8","\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f","\n","$L30","\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","$L31","\n","$L32","\n","$L33","\n","$L34","\n","$L35","\n","$L36","\n","$L37","\n","$L38","\n","$L39","\n","$L3a","\n","$L3b","\n","$L3c","\n","$L3d","\n","$L3e","\n","$L3f","\n","$L40","\n","$L41","\n","$L42","\n","$L43","\n","$L44","\n","$L45","\n","$L46","\n","$L47","\n","$L48","\n","$L49","\n","$L4a","\n","$L4b","\n","$L4c","\n","$L4d","\n","$L4e","\n","$L4f","\n","$L50","\n","$L51","\n","$L52","\n","$L53","\n","$L54","\n","$L55","\n","$L56","\n","$L57","\n","$L58","\n","$L59","\n","$L5a","\n","$L5b","\n","$L5c","\n","$L5d","\n","$L5e","\n","$L5f","\n","$L60","\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","$L61","\n","$L62"