46:["$","ul","ul-11",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"语义"}],"：TCP 段头部的 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Sequence Number"}]," 字段表示该段数据载荷中",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"第一个字节"}],"在整个数据流中的偏移量。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"ACK 机制"}],"：TCP 使用累积确认（Cumulative ACK）。",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Acknowledgment Number"}]," 表示接收端",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"期望收到"}],"的下一个字节的序列号。例如，ACK=1001 意味着 1000 及以前的所有字节均已正确接收。"]}],"\n"]}]
