71:["$","ul","ul-19",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"User-space Scheduling"}],"：KCP 没有内核的中断驱动机制。用户程序必须在一个循环中不断调用 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"ikcp_update(current_time)"}],"。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Tick 频率"}],"：为了获得低延迟，",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"ikcp_update"}]," 通常每 10ms 甚至 1ms 调用一次。这导致 CPU 即使在空闲时也难以进入深度睡眠状态，产生了大量的空轮询开销。"]}],"\n"]}]
72:["$","blockquote","blockquote-7",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["KCP 的本质是在应用层实现了一个",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"高频轮询的调度器"}],"（通常 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"update"}]," 间隔为 10ms）。它比 TCP 多耗费 20%-30% 的流量，换取了低延迟。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":["关于 KCP 更多的底层细节可参阅 ",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"/blog/kcp/","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"/blog/kcp/"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"KCP 源码分析与原理总结","position":{"start":{"line":363,"column":22,"offset":13983},"end":{"line":363,"column":35,"offset":13996}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":363,"column":21,"offset":13982},"end":{"line":363,"column":48,"offset":14009}}},"children":"KCP 源码分析与原理总结"}],"。"]}],"\n"]}]
